# stow skips these. lid-timeout-poweroff(.conf) are reference copies of
# root-owned files installed by hand to /etc/systemd/system-sleep/ and
# /etc/ (system-sleep hooks only run from there); stowed, they landed as
# stray links in ~. A local ignore file replaces stow's defaults, so those
# are repeated here too.
\.git
^/README.*
^/LICENSE.*
^/COPYING
^/lid-timeout-poweroff.*
